WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
Why is an atom neutral?

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:06.330
Protons are positive. Electrons are negative.

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:10.370
An atom has equal numbers of each, so the charges cancel.

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:14.016
Lose one electron, and it becomes an ion.
